        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Mafalda of Savoy, Umberto I of Italy, Victor Emmanuel III of Italy\n- Places: Italy\n- Topics: royal family relationships, ship namesakes, reign lengths\n\nFacts:\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy was the princess after whom SS Principessa Mafalda was named.\n- Umberto I of Italy was the younger brother of Princess Mafalda of Savoy, and he was five years younger than she was.\n- Victor Emmanuel III of Italy became king.\n- The king who was the five-years-younger brother of the princess namesake of SS Principessa Mafalda reigned for 34 days.",
